renderfix-plugin.patch -- jxy333967's render-barrier snapshot refresh and read-only row-pitch fallback for NVMTL, from
https://github.com/samwu07/xegfx-thinkbook14plus-mtl/issues/2 (source pinned at jxy333967/jianxunyun@dfeaac89c81a,
xegfx-render-fixes/patches/0001-nvmtl-row-pitch-and-render-barrier.patch), rebased onto wsmark-plugin.patch and
hostsync-plugin.patch. Only change downstream: its CDX log lines are rate-limited (WindowServer hits them every frame).
Plugin code: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 (unchanged). Applied by 9-wsmark-plugin.sh.

--- pa/plugin/NVMTLObjects.h
